    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n31063" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Nōa</span></b> , ae, and (more freq.) <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Nōē</span></b> ,
